---
import Navigation from "../components/Navigation.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import "@fontsource/work-sans";
import "@fontsource/work-sans/700.css";
import "../styles/global.css";
import "../styles/colophon.css";
import { Font } from "astro:assets";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover"
    />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      type="image/png"
      href="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81783950"
    />
    <Font cssVariable="--font-open-sauce-sans" preload />
    <Font cssVariable="--font-open-sans" preload />
    <Font cssVariable="--font-archivo-black" preload />
    <title>About Me | abucky.dev</title>
    <link rel="sitemap" href="/sitemap-index.xml" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Navigation currentPath={Astro.url.pathname} />
    <main class="main-content">
      <h1>About Me</h1>
      <p>
        Hey, I’m Aaron! I’m a 19-year-old college student and developer working
        towards a bachelor’s in Computer Science. I’ve been interested in
        programming since 3rd grade, when I joined a club where we learned to
        use Scratch and Alice.
      </p>
      <p>
        Throughout middle school, I tinkered with Python and a Freenove
        Raspberry Pi kit, building and making minor changes to the included
        scripts, but nothing major. The biggest jump came in 9th grade, when I
        started one of four years of CS classes.
      </p>
      <h2>Programming</h2>
      <p>
        I’ve worked on a variety of projects, including Discord bots, Python
        libraries, Minecraft Java mods, PowerShell scripts, and hosting
        miscellaneous services on a Pi and on a VPS.
      </p>
      <p>
        I was also on my high school’s robotics team throughout 11th and 12th
        grade. I primarily did programming, though I did a lot of the building
        tasks in 11th grade as well.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
